# Compose foyer build uses context `..` (repo root). Keep the context small.
*
!third_party/
!third_party/juicefs/
!third_party/juicefs/**
!overlays/
!overlays/juicefs/
!overlays/juicefs/**
!scripts/
!scripts/apply-juicefs-overlay.sh
!server/
!server/**

# JuiceFS source is enough; skip VCS and local binaries if they snuck in.
third_party/juicefs/.git
**/.git
**/foyer.exe
server/foyer.exe
**/*.exe
hello.txt
hello-back.txt
hello-back-native.txt
web/
